{"4519460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Operation: Black Genesis - The Immortal Trials", "steam_appid": 4519460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519460/extras/ed23d753fe1d4afcc1a24dd07ac8c4fd.avif?t=1782743948\" alt=\"\"width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Operation: Black Genesis — The Immortal Trials</strong><br><br>Enter deadly Quarantined Zones, fight mutated experiments, and extract with everything you can carry—because if you die, you lose it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In co-op, your team can save you.  Alone… no one is coming.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 ABOUT THIS GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Operation: Black Genesis – The Immortal Trials</strong> is a brutal top-down co-op extraction survival shooter set in a quarantined medical district overrun by failed bio-experiments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a risk.<br>Every decision matters.<br>And not everyone makes it out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ CORE GAMEPLAY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy into dark, hostile <strong>Quarantined Zones</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight mutated bio-experiments in intense, close-quarters encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and scavenge valuable loot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn Credits by surviving and eliminating threats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extract with weapons, ammo and valuables—or lose everything on death</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519460/extras/bd6b19fc3a14e522e02f34f947c510d1.avif?t=1782743948\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >☣️ QUARANTINED ZONES (MAIN EXPERIENCE)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter abandoned medical sectors consumed by infection and chaos.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dangerous, high-risk environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>Tier 1–3 weapons and rare equipment</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face escalating threats the deeper you go</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the call: push forward… or extract while you still can</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519460/extras/696dd4607e42841a72464822e9e57a12.avif?t=1782743948\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519460/extras_big/696dd4607e42841a72464822e9e57a12.avif?t=1782743948 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧟 INFESTED BUNKER (PvE CHALLENGE)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dense, high-pressure survival experience.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through hordes of aggressive infected</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate tight, claustrophobic environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for intense solo or co-op runs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519460/extras/2abd933ca5acc35045eb22edbce4d84d.avif?t=1782743948\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛠️ PREPARE IN THE LOBBY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up before every run.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase weapons, medical supplies, and ammo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend Credits earned from successful extractions </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock stronger and <strong>legendary or mythic-tiered gear</strong> </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧠 RISK vs REWARD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run forces a choice:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay longer for better loot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or extract early and survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save and earn credits</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👥 SOLO OR CO-OP</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone and rely on skill and caution</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or squad up and survive together!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚧 EARLY ACCESS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operation: Black Genesis – The Immortal Trials is actively in development.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New zones, enemies, weapons, and systems are being added</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player feedback directly shapes future updates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world will continue to expand—including a large open-world zone</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Personal Project by IL Labs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>fully self-funded project</strong>, developed independently as a passion-driven experience focused on atmosphere, tension, and uncompromising design. Every system, every encounter, and every detail is built with intent—to deliver a raw, immersive horror experience without compromise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The quarantine is holding... But something inside is still evolving.</strong> </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519460/extras/ed23d753fe1d4afcc1a24dd07ac8c4fd.avif?t=1782743948\" alt=\"\"width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Operation: Black Gen